nt version of `temp` supports `node>=6.0.0`. Updating even a minor version in this case for a package with millions of downloads will definitely be a painful breaking change.\n> \n> \n> \n> How do you feel about updating all dependencies and releasing a major release?\n\nYes, I can take a look at this in a week or so; I'm currently on holiday and a continent and ocean away from my laptop.\n\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bruce/node-temp/issues/comments/2214430382/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bruce/node-temp/issues/comments/2295983631","html_url":"https://github.com/bruce/node-temp/issues/100#issuecomment-2295983631","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bruce/node-temp/issues/100","id":2295983631,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAqhEM6I2e4P","user":{"login":"jisotalo","id":13457157,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDU3MTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13457157?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo","html_url":"https://github.com/jisotalo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jisotalo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-08-19T08:32:10Z","updated_at":"2024-08-19T08:49:53Z","body":"Hi!\r\n\r\nA